"""MCX PAPER BOT V2 — precision-first.
Uses mcx_decision (hard gates + score decomposition) + mcx_regime.
Signal persistence: 2 of last 3 cycles must agree.
Every cycle logged to decisions audit.
NO broker submission. PAPER only.
"""
